{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（18日）清晨6時10分，一名男子在深水埗富昌邨富盈樓單位房間內自縊，家人發現隨即將他解下，並報警求助。</p><p>人員接報到場時，33歲姓黃男子陷入昏迷，由救護車送往明愛醫院搶救，其後被證實死亡。經初步調查，相信事主在上址以一條電線上吊。警方於現場沒有檢獲遺書。據了解，事主因財困萌死念。</p><figure><img alt=\"深水埗富昌邨富盈樓。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1133053708100308992685924.jpeg/mcS1ELKewendgjBeb0K6z5MbfHWbO5Hibn3tPG597Tw\"/><figcaption>深水埗富昌邨富盈樓。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T04:18:48.822202+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T04:07:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T10:57:54.644661+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T04:17:35.335629+00:00","content_hash":"e885b83a6aba0ae734ac219946c32f62ad29bb155f1c6c372a383385521f27ea","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}